    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Lufthansa international flights operate from **Terminal 2** at Kempegowda International Airport Bengaluru. If you are travelling soon, please head to the **Terminal 2 international departure area** for check-in and security. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Lufthansa** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - International Departures &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/) If you’d like, I can also help you with the check-in area, baggage drop, or lounge options for your Lufthansa journey.">
      <data key="d0">chatbot_response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">Lufthansa international flights operate from **Terminal 2**</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Porter service">
      <data key="d0">query</data>
      <data key="d1">Porter service</data>
      <data key="d2">Porter service</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
