    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. If you need customer support at BLR Airport, you can reach our team by phone, WhatsApp, or email. You may also visit the Care by BLR Information Desks at Terminal 1 and Terminal 2 for in-person assistance with airport-related queries. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Care By BLR Information Desk** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Departures and Arrivals &gt; For assistance or service-related queries, you may approach the Care by BLR Information Desk. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/carebyblr/car-valet) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Care By BLR Information Desk** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Departures and Arrivals &gt; For assistance or service-related queries, you may approach the Care by BLR Information Desk. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/carebyblr/car-valet) For direct customer care, please contact: - **Phone:** 080-66785555 / 080-47406666 - **WhatsApp:** +91-8884998888 - **Email:** feedback@bialairport.com **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/contact-us) If you’d like, I can also help you with airline contacts, special assistance, or terminal-specific help.">
