    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. The 080 Transit Hotel is available inside Terminal 1, and it is a convenient place to rest, recharge, and refresh between flights. It is located on Level 2 in the Departure Check-in Hall, and rooms can be booked for a minimum of 3 hours and a maximum of 12 hours. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **080 Transit Hotel** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Departure Check-in Hall, Level 2 &gt; This hotel is meant for passengers with a departure flight ticket from Terminal 1 within 24 hours. It offers complimentary Wi‑Fi, water, tea and coffee in the room, slippers, mini bar, cable television, bathroom and shower amenities, hot water, iron and ironing board on request, a 24x7 coffee shop and restaurant, 24x7 check-in and check-out, and air conditioning. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/080-Transit-Hotel) If you would like, I can also help you with the Taj Bangalore option near Terminal 1.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">080 Transit Hotel is available inside Terminal 1</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. The 080 Transit Hotel is available inside Terminal 2, and it is a convenient place to rest, recharge, and refresh between flights. It is located on Level 2 in the Departure Check-in Hall, and rooms can be booked for a minimum of 3 hours and a maximum of 12 hours. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **080 Transit Hotel** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Departure Check-in Hall, Level 2 &gt; This hotel is meant for passengers with a departure flight ticket from Terminal 2 within 24 hours. It offers complimentary Wi‑Fi, water, tea and coffee in the room, slippers, mini bar, cable television, bathroom and shower amenities, hot water, iron and ironing board on request, a 24x7 coffee shop and restaurant, 24x7 check-in and check-out, and air conditioning. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/080-Transit-Hotel) If you would like, I can also help you with the Taj Bangalore option near Terminal 2.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">080 Transit Hotel is available inside Terminal 2</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here are the parking options available across BLR Airport. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Parking - T1** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Landside &gt; Day and long-term parking facilities are available for passengers with self-driven vehicles. For reduced mobility passengers, a dedicated drop-off and pick-up point is available in the lane closest to the terminal. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking) &gt; **T1 Kerbside Arrival Pick-up 4W** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Arrivals &gt; Free for 00-08 mins, then ₹150 for 08-13 mins and ₹300 for 13-18 mins. Bus parking is ₹600 per hour and tempo traveller parking is ₹300 per hour. Pro-rata charges apply after 18 minutes. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **P3 T1 Car Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 &gt; Free for 00-15 mins, then ₹100 for 15-45 mins, ₹50 for every additional hour, ₹600 for one day, and ₹350 for every additional day. Loss of ticket is ₹600. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **P4 T1 Car Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 &gt; Free for 00-15 mins, then ₹100 for 15-45 mins, ₹50 for every additional hour, ₹600 for one day, and ₹350 for every additional day. Loss of ticket is ₹600. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **T1 Two Wheeler Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 &gt; ₹40 for up to 1 hour, ₹20 for every additional hour, ₹250 for one day, and ₹150 for every additional day. Loss of ticket is ₹250. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **T1 Electric Car Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 &gt; EV slow charging facility is available on chargeable basis, with 20% discount on the original fare. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Parking - T2** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 &gt; Parking is available at the Arrivals level of T2. The closest car parking facility is also at the Arrivals level, and you may follow directional signages or speak to a traffic warden for assistance. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) &gt; **T2 Kerbside Arrival Pick-up 4W** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Arrivals &gt; Free for 00-08 mins, then ₹150 for 08-13 mins and ₹300 for 13-18 mins. Bus parking is ₹600 per hour and tempo traveller parking is ₹300 per hour. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **P2 T2 Car Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 &gt; Free for 00-10 mins, then ₹100 for an additional 30 minutes, ₹50 for every additional hour, ₹1000 for the first 24 hours, and ₹600 for every additional 24 hours. Loss of ticket is ₹600. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **T2 Electric Car Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 &gt; EV fast charging facility is available on chargeable basis, with 20% discount on the original fare. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **Long Term Car Parking at T2** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Arrivals &gt; Long term car parking facility is available at the Arrivals level of T2. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) If you’d like, I can also help you with the nearest parking for your terminal or the pick-up zone charges.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">Here are the parking options available across BLR Airport</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. The Airline Operators Committee (AOC) at BLR Airport is open to all airlines operating at the airport, so membership is not limited to a fixed list. The available information confirms that the committee represents the interests of airlines operating out of BLR Airport, but it does not provide a complete member-by-member airline list. **Airline Partners Information** The AOC is described as an interface between the airline community and Government departments, and it is open to all airlines operating at BLR Airport. **Current Executive Board** - Mr. Bhaskar Mazumdar, Chairman - Mr. Rajesh Menon, Vice Chairman - Mr. Raghavan Narayanan, Secretary **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/airline-partners-information) If you would like, I can also share the airline contact details available for BLR Airport.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">open to all airlines operating at the airport</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here is the Terminal 2 transit hotel option available for a comfortable rest between flights. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **080 Transit Hotel** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Inside Terminal 2 &gt; This transit hotel is located inside Bangalore Airport T2 and is meant for passengers who want to rest, recharge, and refresh between flights. It is especially useful for long layovers, overnight connections, jet lag recovery, and quick relief during delays or cancellations. &gt; &gt; **Room Type:** Deluxe Double &gt; **Max Guests:** 2 Adults, 1 Child &gt; &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/080-Transit-Hotel) If you’d like, I can also help you with nearby food options in T2 or guide you on how to reach the hotel area.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
