    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here are the lounge options available across BLR Airport. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **080 Lounge** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Inside Terminal 1 &gt; This is the domestic lounge in T1, with multiple well-planned zones for comfort, leisure, and entertainment. It is designed for travellers who want to relax, read, or enjoy a meal before their journey. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/bengaluru) &gt; **Care by BLR – Lounge, Terminal 1** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Outside the terminal building &gt; This arrival lounge is thoughtfully designed for arriving and departing passengers, and includes a boardroom, power outlets, and video conferencing equipment. It is a calm space to relax, refresh, or work comfortably before or after travel. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/care-by-blr/arrival-lounge) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **080 Domestic Lounge** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3, Domestic retail corridor &gt; This lounge offers several well-designed spaces, including Garden Dining, Kodagu Café, and a boutique salon. It is a good choice if you want to unwind with food, coffee, or a quick styling service. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/know-more-lounge-blr-terminal2) &gt; **080 International Lounge** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 4, International retail corridor &gt; This lounge features curated food, artisanal coffee, and an attached spa, with interiors inspired by India’s heritage. It is ideal for international travellers looking for a more premium pre-flight experience. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/know-more-lounge-blr-terminal2) &gt; **080 Arrival Lounge** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 0, Arrivals corridor &gt; This arrival lounge is a peaceful place to rest, enjoy a hot beverage, and have a curated meal before heading out of the terminal. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/know-more-lounge-blr-terminal2) If you would like, I can also help you with lounge contact numbers or tell you which lounge fits your terminal and flight type best.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">Here are the lounge options available across BLR Airport</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. If you would like to submit a complaint, you can contact BLR Airport Customer Care directly. For general complaints, suggestions, or feedback about your experience at Kempegowda International Airport, Bengaluru, please use the contact details below. &gt; **Customer Care** &gt; **Phone:** 080-66785555 / 080-47406666 &gt; **WhatsApp:** +91-8884998888 &gt; **Email:** feedback@bialairport.com &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/contact-us) If you would like to escalate a grievance further, the Appellate Authority details are also available: &gt; **Appellate Authority** &gt; **Name:** Gp. Capt. C. Sreenivas VSM, Vice President - Daily Operations &amp; Customer Experience &gt; **Email:** appellateauthority@bialairport.com &gt; **Phone:** +91-8066782325 &gt; **Business Hours:** 08:30 AM to 5:30 PM, Monday to Friday &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/contact-us) If you prefer, I can also help you with the right contact for a specific issue such as lost item, airline complaint, terminal assistance, or accessibility support.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">submit a complaint, you can contact BLR Airport Customer Care</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. If you have a complaint, grievance, question, or concern, you can escalate it directly to BIAL by email at **feedback@bialairport.com** for a swift response and better understanding of your issue. If you need further escalation, the **Appellate Authority** contact is also available through the airport’s Contact Us page. **Complaint Escalation Options** &gt; **BIAL Grievance / Feedback** &gt; **Zone:** Airport Support &gt; Please email **feedback@bialairport.com** with your complaint, grievance, question, or concern so the team can review it and respond. **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/privacy-policy) &gt; **Appellate Authority** &gt; **Zone:** Airport Support &gt; **Email:** appellateauthority@bialairport.com &gt; **Tel:** +91-8066782325 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/contact-us) If you would like, I can also help you with the right contact for a specific issue such as lost item, security concern, special assistance, or airline-related complaint.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">you can escalate it directly to BIAL by email</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here are the domestic lounge options at BLR Airport across both terminals. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **080 Domestic Lounge (East Wing)** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Level 1, East Wing &gt; This lounge is designed with more than 10 well-planned zones and a luxurious, comfortable setting with handcrafted interiors and natural Italian marble flooring. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/know-more-lounge-blr-terminal1) &gt; **080 Domestic Lounge (West Wing)** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Level 1, West Wing &gt; This lounge offers over 8 uniquely designed zones for comfort, leisure, and entertainment, with space to relax, read, watch a movie, or enjoy a specially curated dish. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/know-more-lounge-blr-terminal1) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **080 Domestic Lounge** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 4, Domestic Retail Corridor &gt; This lounge features multiple well-designed spaces, including Garden Dining, Kodagu Café, a boutique salon, a Radio Bar, and spa services. It also offers buffet and à la carte food curated by Celebrity Chef Ranveer Brar. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/know-more-lounge-blr-terminal2) If you would like, I can also help you with the lounge contact numbers or the international lounge options.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">domestic lounge options at BLR Airport</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. I could not find a specific burrito item in the available airport data. However, I did find wrap-style options that may be helpful if you were looking for something similar. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Wrapafella** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - The Quad by BLR &gt; Inspired by street food from around the world, this is a quick and traveller-friendly option for wraps and rolls. It is located at The Quad by BLR, opposite arrivals, and is available 24*7. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience) &gt; **Pizza Hut** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerb Side, Opposite Arrival Gate &gt; A Mexican-style pizza option is available here as a nearby food choice in Terminal 1. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d130a?QueryProp1=Medium%20Pan%20Mexican%20Fiesta) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Costa Coffee** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Between Gate No D6-D9 &gt; Wrap options are available here, including a breakfast wrap and a falafel tomato avocado wrap. This is a convenient choice if you are already in the departure area. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/64d09a82d3be5d5cec40co490?QueryProp1=Wrap%20Breakfast) &gt; **Wendy's** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Kerb Side, Opposite Arrival &gt; Veggie wrap and corn n cheese wrap are available here. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/lakjshdlhqwepouiijaisdqadad7?QueryProp1=VEGGIE%20WRAP) &gt; **PF Changs T2** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3, Domestic Departure &gt; Chicken lettuce wrap and veg lettuce wrap are available here. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/655892a313cd7e350c5de2b9?QueryProp1=Wrap%20Chicken%20Lettuce) &gt; **Jones the Grocer T2** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3, Domestic Departure &gt; Chicken Caesar wrap is available here. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/lakjshdlhqwepouiijaisdqadad?QueryProp1=Wrap%20Chicken%20Caesar) If you want, I can also help you find a specific wrap, bowl, or Mexican-style item in either terminal.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">I could not find a specific burrito item</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. Here are the vegetarian food options I could find in Terminal 1 for you. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Tiffin Express-Bus Gate** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Bus Gate Level 0, Domestic Departure &gt; A good choice for quick South Indian bites. The listing includes **Mung Dal Khichri** and **Samosa 2 Pc**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d115a?QueryProp1=Food%20%26%20Drink) &gt; **Taste of India-G17** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 17 Level 1, Domestic Departure &gt; This outlet has a fuller veg meal selection, including **Palak Paneer**, **Veg Pulao**, **Kadai Vegetable**, **Vegetable Dum Biryani**, **Kulcha**, and **Aloo Tikki**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d120a?QueryProp1=Food%20%26%20Drink) &gt; **KFC-G28** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 28 Level 1, Domestic Departure &gt; If you want a quick snack, this outlet has **2 Pc Veg Strips** and **1 Pc Hot and Crispy**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d121a?QueryProp1=2%20Pc%20Veg%20Strips) &gt; **Starbucks G14** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 14 Level 1, Domestic Departure &gt; Good for a light veg bite. Available items include **Hawaiian Veg Club Sandwich** and **Paneer Tikka Sandwich**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76afa8259252b0e5d110c?QueryProp1=Hawaiian%20Veg%20Club%20Sandwich) &gt; **Aubree** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - T1 Kerb Side &gt; You can find **Italian Veg Calzone** and **Smokey Grilled Veg Sub** here. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d1au1?QueryProp1=Italian%20Veg%20Calzone) &gt; **BARLEY &amp; GRAPES CAFE** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - The Quad by BLR, Opposite Arrivals &gt; This is a nice landside option with **Assorted Veg Crostini Platter** and **Assorted Veg Bruschetta Platter**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d179a?QueryProp1=Assorted%20Veg%20Crostini%20Platter) &gt; **Chaipoint Kerbside** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerb Side, Opposite Arrival Gate &gt; A quick veg snack option with **Veg Pizza Puff**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d141a?QueryProp1=Veg%20Pizza%20Puff) &gt; **Hatti Kaapi** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerb Side, Opposite Arrival Gate &gt; You can get **Spinach &amp; Corn Sandwich With Fries** and **Pepper Mushroom Sandwich With Fries** here. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d112a?QueryProp1=Spinach%20%26%20Corn%20Sandwich%20With%20Fries) If you’d like, I can also narrow this down to: - quick veg snacks - full veg meals - kerbside options only - gate-wise options">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">vegetarian food options I could find in Terminal 1</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here are the KFC options at BLR Airport: **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **KFC-G28** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Domestic Departure, Level 1, Opposite Gate 28 &gt; KFC offers freshly made chicken items and quick bites, including burgers, wings, popcorn chicken, and value meals. This is a convenient stop if you are in Terminal 1 and want a fast meal before your flight. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d121a?QueryProp1=Quick%20Bites) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **KFC T2** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 0 &gt; KFC in Terminal 2 serves chicken meals, burgers, and combo options, making it a handy choice for a quick meal in the terminal. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/64d09a82d3be5d5cec44b290A43?QueryProp1=Food%20%26%20Beverages) If you’d like, I can also share a few popular KFC items available at each terminal.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">KFC options at BLR Airport</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. Here are the sweets outlet options available across the airport. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Aubree** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - T1 Kerb Side &gt; A sweet and gift outlet with chocolates and cakes, suitable if you are at the domestic departure side. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d1au1?QueryProp1=Gifts) &gt; **SMOOR T1** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 15 &amp; Level 1 &gt; This outlet offers sweet items including Cinnabun and artisanal baklava, which can be a lovely pick if you are in the domestic departure area. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/651d0723de3efc67709d0ae1?QueryProp1=Cinnabun) &gt; **Tiffin Express-G17** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 17, Level 1, Domestic Departure &gt; Gulabjamun is available here for passengers near Gate 17. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d132a?QueryProp1=Gulabjamun) &gt; **Tiffin Express-Bus Gate** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Bus Gate Level 0, Domestic Departure &gt; Gulabjamun is available here for passengers using the bus gate area. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d115a?QueryProp1=Gulabjamun) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Duty Free Arrival** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 0 International Baggage Claim Area &gt; Sweet options here include Jumboroll Fanta, Wildberry Pouch, Mini Pralines Box Gold, Italian Dream Mini Book Italy, The Dessert Menu, and other chocolate/sweets selections. Duty Free is exclusively for international passengers. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d144a?QueryProp1=Jumboroll%20Fanta) &gt; **Duty Free Departure** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 1 &gt; This location carries sweets and chocolate items such as Jumboroll Fanta, Wildberry Pouch, Milk Raisins Hazelnuts Almond, Silver Bar Dark Berry Almond, Excellence 85% Cacao, Rocher Tablets Dark 70% Hazelnut, and more. Duty Free is exclusively for international passengers. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/64d09a82d3be5d5cec40la690dut1?QueryProp1=Jumboroll%20Fanta) &gt; **Bhartiya Jalpan T2** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - T2 Arrival Forecourt &gt; Gulab Jamun (2 Pcs) is listed here, but the store is marked inactive in the data. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d125abj?QueryProp1=Gulab%20Jamun%20%282%20Pcs%20%29) &gt; **The Mithai Box** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Domestic, Level 3, Departure &gt; A dedicated mithai outlet with a wide celebration-style sweets selection, open 24 hours. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience/retail-store) &gt; **Anand** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3, Departure &gt; Premium Indian sweets and savouries are available here, open 24 hours. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience) If you’d like, I can also narrow this down to just chocolates, cakes, or sweets near your specific gate.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">sweets outlet options available across the airport</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here are the mithai options I could find across the airport: **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **SMOOR T1** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 15 &amp; Level 1 &gt; This outlet has **Artisanal Baklava Tin - 16Pc**, which is a sweet gifting option. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/651d0723de3efc67709d0ae1?QueryProp1=Artisanal%20Baklava%20Tin%20-%2016Pc) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **THE MITHAI BOX** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Domestic, Level 3, Departure &gt; Open 24 hours and focused on traditional mithai such as Mysore Pak, Dharwad Peda, and other classic sweets. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience/retail-store) &gt; **Bhartiya Jalpan** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Forecourt, Arrivals &gt; Open 24 hours and known for Indian traditional sweets &amp; savouries made with pure desi ghee. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience/culinary-experience) &gt; **Anand** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3, Departure &gt; Open 24 hours and offers premium Indian sweets and savouries. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience/retail-store) If you’d like, I can also narrow this down to **sweet shops in T1 only** or **mithai in T2 arrivals/departures only**.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">mithai options I could find across the airport</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
