    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. I could find pharmacy-related options at BLR Airport. Since you asked broadly for a medical shop, I’m sharing the available pharmacy/medical outlet information across the airport. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Apollo Pharmacy** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Before Security Check, Level 1 &gt; This pharmacy is available before security and is convenient if you are in the landside area. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) &gt; **Manipal Airport Medical Centre** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerbside &gt; Apollo Pharmacy is also available on the kerb at the Manipal Airport Medical Centre, which can be helpful for quick medical needs before entering the terminal. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) &gt; **BLR Airport Medical Centre** &gt; **Zone:** Adjacent to Terminal 1 Building &gt; The medical centre is open 24/7 for passengers and the public. The Terminal 1 clinic is the Manipal Clinic at Level 1, accessible by the escalator alongside counter #86. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/airport-medical-services) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Apollo Pharmacy** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Check-in Hall (Departures), Level 3, Near Departure Gate #3 &gt; This is the pharmacy location mentioned for Terminal 2. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) &gt; **BLR Airport Medical Centre** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Departure Area, Level 3, Next to Gate #3 &gt; The Terminal 2 clinic is the Apollo Clinic, and it is open 24/7 for passengers and the public. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/airport-medical-services) If you’d like, I can also help you with the nearest medical help based on whether you are at T1, T2, or kerbside.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">pharmacy-related options at BLR Airport</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. BLR Airport has 24/7 medical support for passengers and the public, with clinics in both terminals. If you need urgent help, please go to the nearest medical centre or speak to airport staff immediately. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **BLR Airport Medical Centre - Manipal Clinic** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Level 1, adjacent to the Terminal 1 building &gt; Open 24/7 for passengers and the public. Take the escalator alongside counter #86 to reach the clinic. &gt; **Duty Medical Officer:** +91 9606954038 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/airport-medical-services) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **BLR Airport Medical Centre - Apollo Clinic** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3, Departure Area next to Gate #3 &gt; Open 24/7 for passengers and the public. &gt; **Duty Medical Officer:** +91 8884122433 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/airport-medical-services) For assistance related to the Manipal Centre, you may also contact: **Duty Medical Officer (Manipal Centre):** +91 9606954037 If you need mobility support, passengers requiring wheelchair assistance should request it through their airline at least 24 hours before departure.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">BLR Airport has 24/7 medical support</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. For job vacancies and career opportunities at BLR Airport, you can explore the official careers page and apply through the authorised channel. Please be careful about fraudulent job offers and never pay any processing fee to anyone claiming to represent BIAL. **Careers** &gt; **Careers** &gt; **Zone:** Corporate &gt; Explore career opportunities here: [Click to explore career opportunities](https://bialtalent.peoplestrong.com/home) &gt; &gt; For queries, you may write to: **careers@bialairport.com** &gt; &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/corporate/careers) If you would like, I can also help you with the official email for applications or share the fraud warning details from the careers page.">
