    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. Here are the Chaayos options available at BLR: **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Chaayos** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Departure Hall &gt; Open 24 hours. You can find Chaayos at the arrival/departure side in Terminal 2, and it offers a wide range of tea choices such as Chai Kulahd, Chai Vegan, Chai Almond, Chai Kesar, Chai Desi, Tea GingerHoney, Chai Gods, Lemon Iced Tea, Chai Sulemani, Chai Baarish Lemongrass, and Filter Coffee. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience/culinary-experience) &gt; **Chaayos** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Departure Hall &gt; Open 24 hours. This outlet is listed with the same Chaayos brand and serves the same tea range for passengers in Terminal 2. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/64d09a82d3be5d5cec44b290?QueryProp1=Chai%20Kulahd) **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Chai Point** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Domestic Departures, Level 0, Opposite Gate # 21 &gt; Open 24 hours. If you are in Terminal 1, this is the tea option available in the same style of chai/snacks experience. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience) If you’d like, I can also help you with the nearest tea option by terminal or by your gate.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">Chaayos options available at BLR</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. I found fragrance and grooming-related options for “brut” at BLR. Since you did not mention a terminal, I’m sharing the available options across both terminals, and I’ve kept the duty free items separate for easy checking. **Terminal 1 Options** No matching “brut” fragrance or grooming items were found in Terminal 1. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Duty Free Arrival** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 0 International Baggage Claim Area &gt; Available items matching “brut” include **CHANDON BRUT (BOT)**, **Sula Brut Tropicale (BOT)**, **1 Million**, **1 Million Elixir**, **Invictus**, **Le Male Elixir Absolu**, **Nuit Homme Set**, **Big Pony Blue Men**, **Born in Roma Donna Intense**, **Coastal Cypress &amp; Sea Fennel**, **CK One**, and **Rhubarb &amp; Rose Hand Wash**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d144a?QueryProp1=1%20Million) &gt; **Duty Free Departure** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 1 &gt; Available items matching “brut” include **H24**, **CK One**, **CK Everyone**, **Beau De Jour**, **1 Million Set**, **Olympéa**, **L'Homme Intense**, **L'Homme L'Eau**, **L'Homme Cologne Bleue**, **Eau d’Ombré Leather Eau de Toilette**, **Memori Reve Lotus**, **For Him Bleu Noir**, **Le Male Parfum Intense**, **Eau De Rhubarbe Écarlate**, **Pasha Noir Absolu**, **Invictus Travel Set**, **Rhubarb &amp; Rose Hand Wash**, and **Moil Brumes Du Maroc**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/64d09a82d3be5d5cec40la690dut1?QueryProp1=H24) If you meant a specific product like “brut fragrance,” “brut deodorant,” or “brut grooming,” please tell me the exact item name and I’ll narrow it down for you.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">fragrance and grooming-related options for “brut”</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
