    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. If you’re looking for slot booking at BLR, the PreSecure Lane (EZPass by BLR) is available only at Terminal 1, Zone D security checkpoint, Level 0. You can book your security slot through the BLR Pulse app, and it is meant to help you choose a preferred time to join the security queue. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **PreSecure Lane (EZPass by BLR)** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Zone D Security Checkpoint, Level 0 &gt; This is a queue access management facility, not a fast-track security service. You need a valid boarding pass and a QR code generated in the BLR Pulse app. Slots open up to 4 hours before departure and are not permitted within 60 minutes of departure. Please arrive within your booked time window, ideally within ±5 minutes. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/ezpass) To book it, open the BLR Pulse app, upload or scan your boarding pass, choose your preferred slot, and then complete the booking. If you need help at the airport, you may also approach the terminal staff near Zone D security. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/ezpass) If you’d like, I can also help you with the booking window, eligibility, or where exactly to go in Terminal 1.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">PreSecure Lane (EZPass by BLR)</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. If you need wheelchair support at BLR Airport, please request it through your airline in advance. The airport asks passengers to place the request at the time of booking or at least 48 hours before travel, and for Mobility Assist, at least 24 hours before departure. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Wheelchair Assistance** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - PRM/PwD support &gt; Passengers can request wheelchair assistance through their airline. Dedicated PRM/PwD drop-off is available at Lane 1 (behind Third Wave Coffee), Lane 2, and Lane 3. The wheelchair assistance counter is next to Entry Gate 5A, and the dedicated PRM entry for departures is Gate 5A. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/wheelchair-assistance) &gt; **Mobility Assist** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Special assistance &gt; This service supports People with Disabilities with smoother boarding and deplaning, with coordinated support through your airline. Please inform your airline at least 24 hours before departure. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/mobility-assist) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Wheelchair Assistance** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - PRM/PwD support &gt; Passengers can request wheelchair assistance through their airline. Dedicated PRM/PwD drop-off is available at Level 3 Departure Lane 1 and the PRM drop-off area next to the CarebyBLR counter. The wheelchair assistance counter is on Level 3 Lane 1 near CarebyBLR counters, and the dedicated PRM entry for departures is on Level 3. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/wheelchair-assistance) &gt; **Mobility Assist** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Special assistance &gt; This service supports People with Disabilities with smoother boarding and deplaning, with coordinated support through your airline. Please inform your airline at least 24 hours before departure. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/mobility-assist) If you are using a personal wheelchair, please check the approval process with your airline in advance.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">request it through your airline in advance</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. If this is your first time flying from BLR, I can help you with the basic steps so your journey feels much easier and less stressful. Please tell me whether you are arriving at the airport, checking in, or already past security, and I will guide you step by step. For a smooth first-time experience, the usual flow is: 1. Reach the correct terminal for your airline and flight type. 2. Keep your ID and ticket/booking details ready. 3. Check in at the airline counter or use self check-in if available. 4. Drop your baggage if needed. 5. Clear security and proceed to your departure area. 6. Follow the gate number on your boarding pass and airport screens. If you want, I can also help you with: - Which terminal to go to - Check-in and baggage steps - Security process - Gate finding - Food, lounge, or transport options at BLR">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">If this is your first time flying from BLR</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
