    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. I could help with **Your Assured Cab** at BLR. It offers **flat 15% off with code CAB15**, and the service highlights **zero waiting charges, zero surge charges, and zero cancellation charges**. If your flight gets delayed, you can notify the service and they will schedule accordingly. **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/cabs)">
