    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. You can book a parking spot at BLR Airport through the airport’s parking services page. The available parking options include day and long-term parking for self-driven vehicles, along with kerbside pick-up zones and valet parking. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Landside &gt; Day and long-term parking facilities are available for passengers with self-driven vehicles. For Terminal 1, the parking options shown in the airport data include P3 T1 Car Parking, P4 T1 Car Parking, T1 Kerbside Arrival Pick-up 4W, and T1 Electric Car Parking. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking) &gt; **Car Valet** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerbside &gt; Care by BLR Valet Parking Service lets you hand over your vehicle at the car drop-off zone at the kerbside and proceed directly into the terminal. It is shown as suitable for business travellers, short-term visitors, and frequent flyers. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/carebyblr/car-valet) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Landside &gt; Parking options shown in the airport data include P2 T2 Car Parking, T2 Kerbside Arrival Pick-up 4W, T2 Two Wheeler Parking, and T2 Electric Car Parking. For reduced mobility parking, P2 Parking for Reduced Mobility is also listed. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking) &gt; **Car Valet** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Kerbside &gt; Care by BLR Valet Parking Service is available for travellers who want a smoother arrival and departure experience, with vehicle handover at the kerbside and secure parking support. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/carebyblr/car-valet) A few useful parking details from the airport data: - **T1 Car Parking:** 00–15 mins free, 15–45 mins ₹100, every additional 1 hour ₹50, one day ₹600, every additional day ₹350, loss of ticket ₹600. - **T2 Car Parking:** 0–30 mins ₹100, every additional 1 hour ₹50, one day ₹600, every additional day ₹350, loss of ticket ₹600. - **T1 Kerbside Arrival Pick-up 4W:** 00–08 mins free, 08–13 mins ₹150, 13–18 mins ₹300, bus per hour ₹600, tempo traveller per hour ₹300. - **T2 Kerbside Arrival Pick-up 4W:** 00–08 mins free, 08–13 mins ₹150, 13–18 mins ₹300, bus per hour ₹600, tempo traveller per hour ₹300. - **T2 Two Wheeler Parking:** 0–1 hour ₹40, every additional 1 hour ₹20, one day ₹250, every additional day ₹150, loss of ticket ₹250. - **T2 Electric Car Parking:** EV fast charging is available on chargeable basis, with 20% discount on original fare. If you would like, I can also help you with the exact parking charges for your vehicle type or the best parking option for T1 or T2.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">book a parking spot at BLR Airport</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. For a ticket booked through this app, the available booking information mentions that some fares may include flexible rebooking and upgrade options, but the actual upgrade process is handled by the airline. If you are looking to change from Economy to Business Class, please check the airline’s manage booking or contact their customer care directly for the exact upgrade availability. **Flight Booking** &gt; **Cathay Pacific Booking Information** &gt; **Zone:** Flight Booking &gt; Some Economy fares may offer flexible rebooking and upgrade options. Business Class is also available on select Cathay Pacific flights. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/corporate/media/news-press-releases/now-fly-cathay-pacific-from-bengaluru-to-hong-kong-) &gt; **Flight Booking Portal** &gt; **Zone:** Flight Booking &gt; The booking platform mentions transparent pricing and flight booking support, but it does not provide a direct airport-managed upgrade service. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/flights) If you would like, I can also help you with the airline contact details or guide you on what to check in manage booking.">
      <data key="d0">response</data>
