    <edge source="Which terminal handles Lufthansa flights?" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Lufthansa international flights operate from **Terminal 2** at Kempegowda International Airport Bengaluru. If you are travelling soon, please head to the **Terminal 2 international departure area** for check-in and security. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Lufthansa** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - International Departures &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/) If you’d like, I can also help you with the check-in area, baggage drop, or lounge options for your Lufthansa journey." id="is_answered_by">
