      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Which terminal handles Lufthansa flights?" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Lufthansa international flights operate from Terminal 2 at Kempegowda International Airport Bengaluru. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Lufthansa** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - International Departures &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/airline-partners-information)" id="is_answered_by">
