    <edge source="Porter service" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. The Porter Service at BLR Airport provides professional baggage assistance to help you move comfortably through the terminal, whether you are arriving or departing. It is especially helpful for families, senior citizens, passengers with multiple or heavy bags, and anyone who would like a smoother airport journey. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Porter Service** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerbside to Check-in Counters / Baggage Claim to Exit Gate &gt; This service helps carry and transport your luggage from the kerbside to the check-in counters for departures, or from baggage claim to the exit gate for arrivals. It can be customized as per your requirement, and up to 3 bags per porter are allowed. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/cbb-services-listing) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Porter Service** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Kerbside to Check-in Counters / Baggage Claim to Exit Gate &gt; This service helps carry and transport your luggage from the kerbside to the check-in counters for departures, or from baggage claim to the exit gate for arrivals. It can be customized as per your requirement, and up to 3 bags per porter are allowed. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/care-by-blr/porter) If you would like, I can also share the booking contact for porter service." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ez pass" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. EZPass by BLR is a PreSecure Lane that lets you choose a preferred time window to join the security check queue at Terminal 1, Zone D. It is a timed entry pass for the queue only, so it does not skip or fast-track security screening. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **EZPass by BLR** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Zone D security checkpoint, Level 0 &gt; You can book a slot through the BLR Pulse app after completing web check-in. Entry to the queue starts 4 hours before scheduled departure, and bookings are not allowed within 60 minutes of departure. Please keep your QR code and boarding pass ready when you arrive. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/ezpass) If you would like, I can also help you with how to book it step by step." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="What are Vayu Vajra timings?" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. At present, BMTC is operating select Vayu Vajra routes, and the updated timings can change based on the route. For the latest schedule, please check BMTC’s official website. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Vayu Vajra** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Transport &gt; The BMTC Vayu Vajra AC bus service is an efficient and inexpensive way to travel to and from the city. It accepts both cash and UPI payments upon boarding. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/airport-VayuVajra) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Vayu Vajra** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Transport &gt; The BMTC Vayu Vajra AC bus service is an efficient and inexpensive way to travel to and from the city. It accepts both cash and UPI payments upon boarding. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/airport-VayuVajra) For route-wise updated timings, please visit BMTC’s official schedule page: **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://mybmtc.karnataka.gov.in/english)" id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="where can i find the ATM in the airport" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. ATMs are available across both terminals, and I’ve listed the locations below so you can quickly find the nearest one. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerbside, Departure Hall, Common Arrival Hall, Domestic Boarding Gates, and Customs Green Channel Area &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Opposite Entry Gate 1 Kerbside &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Opposite Entry Gate 8 Kerbside &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Opposite Superdry Outlet, Quad &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Opposite Arrival Exit Gate 11 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Next to Entry Gate 5A, Inside Check-in Hall &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Next to SpiceJet ATO No. 09 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Opposite Starbucks Outlet, BG 15 Zone B &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Next to Arrival Gate 13, Inside the Terminal &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3 Departure Forecourt Area &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3 Check-in Hall &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3 Domestic Security Hold Area &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3 Common Arrival Hall &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) &gt; **ATM** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 0 Arrival Forecourt Area &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/forex-atms) If you’d like, I can also help you find the nearest ATM based on whether you are in arrivals, departures, or at the kerbside." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="own electric wheelchair" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. If you are travelling with your own electric wheelchair, please inform your respective airline in advance so they can coordinate the required process and approvals with BLR Airport. For wheelchair assistance, the request should be placed at the time of booking or at least 48 hours before travel. **Wheelchair Assistance** &gt; **Wheelchair Assistance** &gt; **Zone:** Special Assistance - Wheelchair Assistance &gt; Passengers requiring wheelchair assistance at BLR Airport must place a request with the respective airlines at the time of booking tickets or 48 hours prior to their travel. Passengers using personal wheelchairs are requested to contact the respective airlines in advance regarding the processes and approvals. There are dedicated zones reserved for passenger drop-off and pick-up when availing wheelchair assistance at BLR Airport. Please speak to the on-ground team for assistance. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/wheelchair-assistance) &gt; **Mobility Assist** &gt; **Zone:** Special Assistance - Mobility Assist &gt; Seamless Mobility Support for People with Disabilities. This service helps make boarding and deplaning comfortable and dignified, with smooth transfers and coordinated support in partnership with your airline. Please inform your airline at least 24 hours prior to departure. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/mobility-assist) If you would like, I can also help you with the nearest wheelchair assistance counter or the PRM drop-off locations in T1 or T2." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="buggy service inside terminal" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Complimentary buggy service is available inside the terminal for senior citizens, expectant mothers, passengers with reduced mobility, injury, and also for families travelling with infants and young children. It is available both at arrival and departure zones, and our ground staff can help you with it. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Buggy Service** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - After security check, and also at PRM drop-off locations, elevated walkway, arrival exit areas, and near baggage claim &gt; Complimentary buggy service is available for passengers who need assistance moving through the terminal. In Terminal 1, it can be found at PRM Drop-off Lane 2, PRM Drop-off Lane 3, the elevated walkway, opposite Arrival Gate 10, opposite Hamleys outlet, next to Rare Planet, Arrival Corridor near Gate A5, and Baggage Belt 07. &gt; &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/buggy-service) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Buggy Service** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - After security check, departure areas, arrival exit areas, and domestic arrival near baggage claim &gt; Complimentary buggy service is available in Terminal 2 for passengers who need assistance. You can ask the ground staff at Level 3 Departure Lane 1 near the PRM Drop-off Area and CarebyBLR Counter, Departure after Security near Orientation Garden, Departure Post Security near Starbucks, Arrival Exit Gates, Domestic Arrival Exit near Baggage Claim, and Level 0 Arrival Exit. &gt; &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/buggy-service) If you are already inside the terminal and need help finding the nearest buggy point, please tell me whether you are in T1 or T2, and I will guide you more precisely." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="rest pods" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. For rest or recharge in Terminal 2, the closest match I could find is the 080 Transit Hotel inside T2. It is designed for passengers who want to rest between flights, with hourly and overnight bookings available, and a minimum package of 4 hours. 080 Transit Hotel Zone: Terminal 2 - Inside Terminal 2 Located inside Bangalore Airport T2, this transit hotel is meant for long layovers, quick relief during delays, jet lag recovery, and overnight connections. It offers Deluxe Single and Double rooms, along with air conditioning, cable TV, minibar, free Wi‑Fi, a restaurant, and 24/7 service. Guests also have the option to access the 080 Lounge. Reference: Click here for more details. If you were specifically looking for a dedicated rest pod facility, I couldn’t find one in the available Terminal 2 data." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="where can i find terminal map" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. You can find the terminal map on the airport’s Indoor Map page. I’m sharing the map link below so you can open it directly and use it for navigation inside the airport. Terminal 1 Options Indoor Map Zone: Terminal 1 - Airport Map Use this map to look up airport locations and plan your movement inside the terminal. Reference: Click here for more details Terminal 2 Options Indoor Map Zone: Terminal 2 - Airport Map Use this map to look up airport locations and plan your movement inside the terminal. Reference: Click here for more details If you’d like, I can also help you with the exact location of a shop, lounge, gate, or facility on the map." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="coffee shop in T1" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here are the coffee shop options in Terminal 1: **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Third Wave Coffee** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerb Side Departure &gt; A convenient stop if you’re at the curbside area before entering the terminal. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d1232a?QueryProp1=Quick%20Bites) &gt; **Third Wave Coffee DSHA** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Domestic SHA &gt; A good option if you are already past security in the domestic departure area. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/64d09a82d3be5d5cec44b290BIAL0240?QueryProp1=Quick%20Bites) &gt; **SMOOR T1** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 15 &amp; Level 1 &gt; Coffee options available here include Cafe Latte and Cafe Mocha. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/651d0723de3efc67709d0ae1?QueryProp1=Cafe%20Latte) &gt; **Starbucks G14** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 14 Level 1, Domestic Departure &gt; Freshly brewed coffee options are available here, including Tall Cold Coffee and Tall Coffee Frappuccino. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76afa8259252b0e5d110c?QueryProp1=Gifts) &gt; **La Alta Vita-G12** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 12 Level 1, Domestic Departure &gt; Coffee options available here include 1 Shot Espresso and Café Latte M. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d122a?QueryProp1=1%20Shot%20Espresso) &gt; **Tiffin Express-G17** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 17 Level 1, Domestic Departure &gt; Coffee options available here include Filter Coffee and Raw Protein Cold Coffee. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d132a?QueryProp1=Filter%20Coffee) If you’d like, I can also narrow this down to the nearest coffee shop based on where you are in T1." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="diaper changing room T1" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. I found baby care rooms with changing facilities for your diaper-changing need. Terminal 1 is currently under renovation for this facility, so the available options are in Terminal 2. Terminal 1 Options Baby Care Rooms Zone: Terminal 1 - Currently being renovated Dedicated baby care rooms are designed to provide a private and comfortable space for parents to attend to the needs of their baby / infant. Equipped with changing tables, comfortable seating, sanitary facilities, microwave and more. Reference: Click here for more details Terminal 2 Options Baby Care Rooms Baby Care Rooms Zone: Terminal 2 - International_x000D_ _x000D_ Orientation garden – Level 3_x000D_ Retail zone washroom passage near Rare Planet – Level 3_x000D_ Near boarding gate #C6 – Level 3_x000D_ Duty-free exit opposite arrival belt Dedicated baby care rooms are designed to provide a private and comfortable space for parents to attend to the needs of their baby / infant. Equipped with changing tables, comfortable seating, sanitary facilities, microwave and more. Reference: Click here for more detailsZone: Terminal 2 - Domestic_x000D_ _x000D_ Orientation garden – Level 3_x000D_ Retail zone washroom passage near SS Beauty – Level 3_x000D_ Boarding gate (D10) waiting area – Level 3_x000D_ Common arrival hall near Ebix counter – Level 0_x000D_ Next to Reserved lounge opposite arrival belt #6 – Level 0_x000D_ After sunken garden at arrival – Level 1_x000D_ Common departure hall near island F – Level 3 Dedicated baby care rooms are designed to provide a private and comfortable space for parents to attend to the needs of their baby / infant. Equipped with changing tables, comfortable seating, sanitary facilities, microwave and more. Reference: Click here for more details If you’d like, I can also help you find the nearest one based on whether you’re in arrivals, departures, or near a specific gate." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Who do I contact if I have lost something at the airport" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. If you have lost something at BLR Airport, you can contact the Lost &amp; Found team by terminal: **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Lost &amp; Found** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerbside and Arrivals, next to Gate No. 13 (staff entry/exit gate) &gt; **Contact:** lostandfound@bialairport.com | +91-8047406666 &gt; **Hours:** Round the clock, 24/7 &gt; **Claim Response Time:** Within 3 business days &gt; &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/lost-found) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Lost &amp; Found** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Arrivals level, behind Airport Shuttle drop-off &amp; pick-up points (P16 / P17) &gt; **Contact:** t2lostandfound@bialairport.com | +91-8066785555 &gt; **Hours:** Round the clock, 24/7 &gt; **Claim Response Time:** Within 3 business days &gt; &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/lost-found) If you are unable to find your item in the search, please write to the relevant terminal email or call the number above. If the item was lost onboard the aircraft or at the gate area, please contact the concerned airline as they may follow a different process." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Which Airlines/flights operate from Terminal 1" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited . Thank you for contacting us. **Terminal 1 Airlines and Flights** Terminal 1 handles domestic flights only for **IndiGo**, **Akasa Air**, **SpiceJet**, and **Alliance Air**. Based on the live flight data you shared, these are the Terminal 1 flights currently operating: **IndiGo** IndiGo operates multiple domestic flights from Terminal 1. The flights shown in the data are: - **6E499** — Varanasi ➔ Bengaluru - **6E846** — Delhi ➔ Bengaluru - **6E361** — Pune ➔ Bengaluru - **6E6564** — Pune ➔ Bengaluru - **6E996** — Ahmedabad ➔ Bengaluru - **6E871** — Delhi ➔ Bengaluru - **6E5388** — Mumbai ➔ Bengaluru - **6E573** — Kolkata ➔ Bengaluru - **6E906** — Lucknow ➔ Bengaluru - **6E6055** — Pune ➔ Bengaluru - **6E820** — Delhi ➔ Bengaluru - **6E5294** — Mumbai ➔ Bengaluru - **6E6877** — Pune ➔ Bengaluru - **6E413** — Hyderabad ➔ Bengaluru **Akasa Air** Akasa Air operates domestic flights from Terminal 1. The flights shown in the data are: - **QP1812** — Delhi ➔ Bengaluru - **QP1350** — Delhi ➔ Bengaluru - **QP1516** — Mumbai ➔ Bengaluru - **QP1901** — Ahmedabad ➔ Bengaluru **SpiceJet** SpiceJet operates domestic flights from Terminal 1. The flight shown in the data is: - **SG874** — Mumbai ➔ Bengaluru **Alliance Air** No Terminal 1 Alliance Air flight is shown in the live data you shared. If you want, I can also list the Terminal 1 flights by status, by destination, or by airline in a cleaner flight-by-flight format." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Which Airlines/flights operate from Terminal 2" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited . Thank you for contacting us. **Terminal 2 Flights** Terminal 2 handles all international flights, and it also handles domestic flights for Air India, Air India Express, and Star Air. Based on the live flight data you shared, these are the flights operating from Terminal 2: **Cathay Pacific Flight CX623** **Route:** Hong Kong ➔ Bengaluru **Status:** Arrived **Time:** 2026-07-20 00:10:00 **Location:** Terminal T2 | Gate: C3 | Baggage Belt: 3B,3A 🔗 **Reference:** [Click here for live flight updates](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/flight-information?flight=CX623) **Air India Flight AI2412** **Route:** Delhi ➔ Bengaluru **Status:** Arrived **Time:** 2026-07-20 00:25:00 **Location:** Terminal T2 | Gate: T2DA | Baggage Belt: 8A 🔗 **Reference:** [Click here for live flight updates](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/flight-information?flight=AI2412) **Lufthansa Flight LH754** **Route:** Frankfurt ➔ Bengaluru **Status:** Arrived **Time:** 2026-07-20 01:20:00 **Location:** Terminal T2 | Gate: C3 | Baggage Belt: 2B,2A 🔗 **Reference:** [Click here for live flight updates](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/flight-information?flight=LH754) **Qatar Airways Flight QR572** **Route:** Doha ➔ Bengaluru **Status:** Arrived **Time:** 2026-07-20 02:30:00 **Location:** Terminal T2 | Gate: D2 | Baggage Belt: 3B,3A 🔗 **Reference:** [Click here for live flight updates](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/flight-information?flight=QR572) **Emirates Flight EK568** **Route:** Dubai ➔ Bengaluru **Status:** Arrived **Time:** 2026-07-20 02:50:00 **Location:** Terminal T2 | Gate: C5 | Baggage Belt: 4B,4A 🔗 **Reference:** [Click here for live flight updates](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/flight-information?flight=EK568) **Air India Flight AI2757** **Route:** Delhi ➔ Bengaluru **Status:** Arrived **Time:** 2026-07-20 03:10:00 **Location:** Terminal T2 | Gate: D8 | Baggage Belt: 7A 🔗 **Reference:** [Click here for live flight updates](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/flight-information?flight=AI2757) **Air India Express Flight IX920** **Route:** Dubai ➔ Bengaluru **Status:** Arrived **Time:** 2026-07-20 05:10:00 **Location:** Terminal T2 | Gate: C3 | Baggage Belt: 1A,1B 🔗 **Reference:** [Click here for live flight updates](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/flight-information?flight=IX920) **Air India Express Flight IX1542** **Route:** Lucknow ➔ Bengaluru **Status:** Arrived **Time:** 2026-07-20 00:05:00 **Location:** Terminal T2 | Gate: D13 | Baggage Belt: 7B 🔗 **Reference:** [Click here for live flight updates](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/flight-information?flight=IX1542) **Alliance Air Flight 9I548** **Route:** Goa ➔ Bengaluru **Status:** Arrived **Time:** 2026-07-20 00:25:00 **Location:** Terminal T2 | Gate: T2DA | Baggage Belt: 8B 🔗 **Reference:** [Click here for live flight updates](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/flight-information?flight=9I548) **Air India Express Flight IX5202** **Route:** Mangalore ➔ Bengaluru **Status:** Arrived **Time:** 2026-07-20 00:15:00 **Location:** Terminal T2 | Gate: D8 | Baggage Belt: 8B 🔗 **Reference:** [Click here for live flight updates](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/flight-information?flight=IX5202) Would you like me to list the later Terminal 2 flights as well, or check a specific airline or flight number?" id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="where can i find medical facility at the airpor" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. You can find the airport medical facilities at both terminals, and they are open 24/7 for passengers and the public. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **BLR Airport Medical Centre (Manipal Clinic)** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Level 1, adjacent to the Terminal 1 building. Please take the escalator alongside counter #86. &gt; **Duty Medical Officer:** +91 9606954038 &gt; **For assistance:** +91 9606954037 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/airport-medical-services) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **BLR Airport Medical Centre (Apollo Clinic)** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3, Departure Area next to Gate #3. &gt; **Duty Medical Officer:** +91 8884122433 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/airport-medical-services) If you need help reaching the clinic quickly, please ask any airport staff or the nearest information desk, and they will guide you right away." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="where are BLR_Free_ WiFi kiosk locations" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. You can find the BLR_Free_WiFi voucher kiosk in the International arrivals area. If you do not have your boarding pass, you can also visit the virtual information desk to get a WiFi PIN. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **WiFi Voucher Kiosk** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - International Arrivals Area &gt; The kiosk is used to scan the photo page of your passport and boarding pass, then collect your WiFi voucher. After that, connect to **BLR_Free_WiFi** and complete the login steps with your local phone number and OTP. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/all-facilities/wifi-services) &gt; **Virtual Information Desk** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Arrivals / Assistance Area &gt; If you do not have your boarding pass, you can visit the virtual information desk to get a WiFi PIN and continue the WiFi login process. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/corporate/media/news-press-releases/information-desk-at-blr-airport-goes-virtual) If you’d like, I can also help you with the exact steps to connect after collecting the voucher." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="cash was not dispensed from the airport ATM, whom to complaint" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out._x000D_ _x000D_ I’m very sorry for the trouble with the ATM. For an ATM cash-dispensing issue at BLR Airport, please contact our customer care team at 080-66785555 or 080-47406666, or email feedback@bialairport.com. If you are still near the ATM, you may also approach the nearest Care by BLR Information Desk for immediate assistance._x000D_ _x000D_ Reference: Click here for more details" id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="where can i buy sim card at the airport" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. You can buy a local SIM card at BLR Airport in Terminal 2. The facility is available at Level 0 in Arrivals near the Transfers area, and international passengers can also purchase it from CXSOL (Connectivity/Customer Solutions) near Exit Gate 1 at the arrival zone. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **CXSOL (Connectivity/Customer Solutions)** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 0, Arrivals near Transfers area / arrival zone near Exit Gate 1 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/all-facilities/local-connectivity) &gt; **Local Connectivity** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 0, Arrivals near Transfers area &gt; This facility is available for purchasing local SIM cards. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial)" id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
