    <edge source="Lost &amp; Found" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. If you’ve lost something at BLR, you can search for your item online and then claim it if there’s a match. The Lost &amp; Found desk is open 24/7, and claims are usually responded to within 3 business days. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Lost &amp; Found** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerbside and Departure Hall, next to Staff Gate No. 13 &gt; You can write to **lostandfound@bialairport.com** or call **+91-8047406666** if you cannot find your item in the search. &gt; Please keep your **boarding pass**, a **valid Government photo ID**, and the **details of the item** ready when you claim it. &gt; If someone else is collecting it for you, they will also need their ID, your ID, your boarding pass, and an authorization letter from you. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/lost-found) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Lost &amp; Found** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Arrivals level, behind the Airport Shuttle drop-off &amp; pick-up points at P16 / P17 &gt; You can write to **t2lostandfound@bialairport.com** or call **+91-8066785555** if you cannot find your item in the search. &gt; Please keep your **boarding pass**, a **valid Government photo ID**, and the **details of the item** ready when you claim it. &gt; If someone else is collecting it for you, they will also need their ID, your ID, your boarding pass, and an authorization letter from you. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/lost-found) If the item was lost **on board the flight or at the gate area**, please contact the **airline’s Lost and Found department** directly, as their process may be different." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
