    <edge source="Delayed flight" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited, I am still learning, so please reach out to customer support at **+91-80-22012001** or **+91-80-66785555**, message us via WhatsApp at **+91-8884998888**, or visit **[Airline Partners Information | Airlines at Bangalore Airport](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/airline-partners-information)** for the most accurate details and direct assistance regarding your airline." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Visitor pass" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Visitors are not allowed inside the terminal as per a directive from the Bureau of Civil Aviation Security. If you need help with airport access for a passenger, please let me know what you’re trying to do, and I’ll guide you with the correct airport process. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Visitor Entry** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Landside &gt; Visitors are not allowed inside the terminal as per a directive from the Bureau of Civil Aviation Security. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) If you meant a passenger-related entry or check-in requirement, I can also help with boarding pass, ID, or terminal access guidance." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Parking" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here are the parking options available across BLR Airport. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Parking - T1** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Landside &gt; Day and long-term parking facilities are available for passengers with self-driven vehicles. For reduced mobility passengers, a dedicated drop-off and pick-up point is available in the lane closest to the terminal. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking) &gt; **T1 Kerbside Arrival Pick-up 4W** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Arrivals &gt; Free for 00-08 mins, then ₹150 for 08-13 mins and ₹300 for 13-18 mins. Bus parking is ₹600 per hour and tempo traveller parking is ₹300 per hour. Pro-rata charges apply after 18 minutes. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **P3 T1 Car Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 &gt; Free for 00-15 mins, then ₹100 for 15-45 mins, ₹50 for every additional hour, ₹600 for one day, and ₹350 for every additional day. Loss of ticket is ₹600. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **P4 T1 Car Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 &gt; Free for 00-15 mins, then ₹100 for 15-45 mins, ₹50 for every additional hour, ₹600 for one day, and ₹350 for every additional day. Loss of ticket is ₹600. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **T1 Two Wheeler Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 &gt; ₹40 for up to 1 hour, ₹20 for every additional hour, ₹250 for one day, and ₹150 for every additional day. Loss of ticket is ₹250. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **T1 Electric Car Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 &gt; EV slow charging facility is available on chargeable basis, with 20% discount on the original fare. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Parking - T2** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 &gt; Parking is available at the Arrivals level of T2. The closest car parking facility is also at the Arrivals level, and you may follow directional signages or speak to a traffic warden for assistance. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) &gt; **T2 Kerbside Arrival Pick-up 4W** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Arrivals &gt; Free for 00-08 mins, then ₹150 for 08-13 mins and ₹300 for 13-18 mins. Bus parking is ₹600 per hour and tempo traveller parking is ₹300 per hour. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **P2 T2 Car Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 &gt; Free for 00-10 mins, then ₹100 for an additional 30 minutes, ₹50 for every additional hour, ₹1000 for the first 24 hours, and ₹600 for every additional 24 hours. Loss of ticket is ₹600. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **T2 Electric Car Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 &gt; EV fast charging facility is available on chargeable basis, with 20% discount on the original fare. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **Long Term Car Parking at T2** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Arrivals &gt; Long term car parking facility is available at the Arrivals level of T2. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) If you’d like, I can also help you with the nearest parking for your terminal or the pick-up zone charges." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Transit Hotels T2" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here is the Terminal 2 transit hotel option available for a comfortable rest between flights. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **080 Transit Hotel** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Inside Terminal 2 &gt; This transit hotel is located inside Bangalore Airport T2 and is meant for passengers who want to rest, recharge, and refresh between flights. It is especially useful for long layovers, overnight connections, jet lag recovery, and quick relief during delays or cancellations. &gt; &gt; **Room Type:** Deluxe Double &gt; **Max Guests:** 2 Adults, 1 Child &gt; &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/080-Transit-Hotel) If you’d like, I can also help you with nearby food options in T2 or guide you on how to reach the hotel area." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Is parking there in T2 for private cars" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Yes, private car parking is available at Terminal 2. The closest parking facility is at the Arrivals level of T2, and long-term car parking is also available there. Please follow the directional signages or speak to a traffic warden for help. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **P2 T2 Car Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Arrivals level &gt; This parking is available for private cars. The fare is 00–10 mins free, additional 30 mins ₹100, every additional 1 hour ₹50, premium parking first 24 hours ₹1000, every additional 24 hours ₹600, and loss of ticket ₹600. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/transport-parking/parking) &gt; **Long-Term Car Parking** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Arrivals level &gt; Long-term car parking facility is available at T2. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) If you’d like, I can also help with the nearest pick-up point or electric car parking at T2." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dewars" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. I found Dewar’s options in Terminal 2. Since you asked broadly, I’m sharing the available choices I could verify for you. **Terminal 1 Options** I could not find a verified Dewar’s listing in Terminal 1 from the available information. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Dewar’s 12 Years** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 4 - Radio House Bar &gt; This listing is available in the airport data, and it is marked as collect at store. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d1038a?QueryProp1=Dewar%27s%2012%20years) &gt; **Dewar’s White Label** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 4 - Radio House Bar &gt; This listing is available in the airport data, and it is marked as collect at store. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d1038a?QueryProp1=Dewar%27s%20White%20Label) &gt; **12 Year Old Twin Pack** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 1 - Duty Free Departure &gt; This is a duty free collect-at-store item. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/64d09a82d3be5d5cec40la690dut1?QueryProp1=12%20Year%20Old%20Twin%20Pack) If you’d like, I can also help you with the exact whisky type you want, like blended whisky, single malt, or duty free twin packs." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lounges" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here are the lounge options available across BLR Airport. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **080 Lounge** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Inside Terminal 1 &gt; This is the domestic lounge in T1, with multiple well-planned zones for comfort, leisure, and entertainment. It is designed for travellers who want to relax, read, or enjoy a meal before their journey. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/bengaluru) &gt; **Care by BLR – Lounge, Terminal 1** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Outside the terminal building &gt; This arrival lounge is thoughtfully designed for arriving and departing passengers, and includes a boardroom, power outlets, and video conferencing equipment. It is a calm space to relax, refresh, or work comfortably before or after travel. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/care-by-blr/arrival-lounge) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **080 Domestic Lounge** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3, Domestic retail corridor &gt; This lounge offers several well-designed spaces, including Garden Dining, Kodagu Café, and a boutique salon. It is a good choice if you want to unwind with food, coffee, or a quick styling service. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/know-more-lounge-blr-terminal2) &gt; **080 International Lounge** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 4, International retail corridor &gt; This lounge features curated food, artisanal coffee, and an attached spa, with interiors inspired by India’s heritage. It is ideal for international travellers looking for a more premium pre-flight experience. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/know-more-lounge-blr-terminal2) &gt; **080 Arrival Lounge** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 0, Arrivals corridor &gt; This arrival lounge is a peaceful place to rest, enjoy a hot beverage, and have a curated meal before heading out of the terminal. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/know-more-lounge-blr-terminal2) If you would like, I can also help you with lounge contact numbers or tell you which lounge fits your terminal and flight type best." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Where and to whom to submit complaint" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. If you would like to submit a complaint, you can contact BLR Airport Customer Care directly. For general complaints, suggestions, or feedback about your experience at Kempegowda International Airport, Bengaluru, please use the contact details below. &gt; **Customer Care** &gt; **Phone:** 080-66785555 / 080-47406666 &gt; **WhatsApp:** +91-8884998888 &gt; **Email:** feedback@bialairport.com &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/contact-us) If you would like to escalate a grievance further, the Appellate Authority details are also available: &gt; **Appellate Authority** &gt; **Name:** Gp. Capt. C. Sreenivas VSM, Vice President - Daily Operations &amp; Customer Experience &gt; **Email:** appellateauthority@bialairport.com &gt; **Phone:** +91-8066782325 &gt; **Business Hours:** 08:30 AM to 5:30 PM, Monday to Friday &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/contact-us) If you prefer, I can also help you with the right contact for a specific issue such as lost item, airline complaint, terminal assistance, or accessibility support." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="What are the complaint escalation steps?" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. If you have a complaint, grievance, question, or concern, you can escalate it directly to BIAL by email at **feedback@bialairport.com** for a swift response and better understanding of your issue. If you need further escalation, the **Appellate Authority** contact is also available through the airport’s Contact Us page. **Complaint Escalation Options** &gt; **BIAL Grievance / Feedback** &gt; **Zone:** Airport Support &gt; Please email **feedback@bialairport.com** with your complaint, grievance, question, or concern so the team can review it and respond. **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/privacy-policy) &gt; **Appellate Authority** &gt; **Zone:** Airport Support &gt; **Email:** appellateauthority@bialairport.com &gt; **Tel:** +91-8066782325 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/contact-us) If you would like, I can also help you with the right contact for a specific issue such as lost item, security concern, special assistance, or airline-related complaint." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Domestic Lounge" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here are the domestic lounge options at BLR Airport across both terminals. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **080 Domestic Lounge (East Wing)** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Level 1, East Wing &gt; This lounge is designed with more than 10 well-planned zones and a luxurious, comfortable setting with handcrafted interiors and natural Italian marble flooring. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/know-more-lounge-blr-terminal1) &gt; **080 Domestic Lounge (West Wing)** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Level 1, West Wing &gt; This lounge offers over 8 uniquely designed zones for comfort, leisure, and entertainment, with space to relax, read, watch a movie, or enjoy a specially curated dish. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/know-more-lounge-blr-terminal1) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **080 Domestic Lounge** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 4, Domestic Retail Corridor &gt; This lounge features multiple well-designed spaces, including Garden Dining, Kodagu Café, a boutique salon, a Radio Bar, and spa services. It also offers buffet and à la carte food curated by Celebrity Chef Ranveer Brar. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/relax/lounges/know-more-lounge-blr-terminal2) If you would like, I can also help you with the lounge contact numbers or the international lounge options." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Burrito" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. I could not find a specific burrito item in the available airport data. However, I did find wrap-style options that may be helpful if you were looking for something similar. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Wrapafella** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - The Quad by BLR &gt; Inspired by street food from around the world, this is a quick and traveller-friendly option for wraps and rolls. It is located at The Quad by BLR, opposite arrivals, and is available 24*7. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience) &gt; **Pizza Hut** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerb Side, Opposite Arrival Gate &gt; A Mexican-style pizza option is available here as a nearby food choice in Terminal 1. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d130a?QueryProp1=Medium%20Pan%20Mexican%20Fiesta) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Costa Coffee** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Between Gate No D6-D9 &gt; Wrap options are available here, including a breakfast wrap and a falafel tomato avocado wrap. This is a convenient choice if you are already in the departure area. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/64d09a82d3be5d5cec40co490?QueryProp1=Wrap%20Breakfast) &gt; **Wendy's** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Kerb Side, Opposite Arrival &gt; Veggie wrap and corn n cheese wrap are available here. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/lakjshdlhqwepouiijaisdqadad7?QueryProp1=VEGGIE%20WRAP) &gt; **PF Changs T2** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3, Domestic Departure &gt; Chicken lettuce wrap and veg lettuce wrap are available here. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/655892a313cd7e350c5de2b9?QueryProp1=Wrap%20Chicken%20Lettuce) &gt; **Jones the Grocer T2** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3, Domestic Departure &gt; Chicken Caesar wrap is available here. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/lakjshdlhqwepouiijaisdqadad?QueryProp1=Wrap%20Chicken%20Caesar) If you want, I can also help you find a specific wrap, bowl, or Mexican-style item in either terminal." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="1 veg options" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. Here are the vegetarian food options I could find in Terminal 1 for you. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Tiffin Express-Bus Gate** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Bus Gate Level 0, Domestic Departure &gt; A good choice for quick South Indian bites. The listing includes **Mung Dal Khichri** and **Samosa 2 Pc**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d115a?QueryProp1=Food%20%26%20Drink) &gt; **Taste of India-G17** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 17 Level 1, Domestic Departure &gt; This outlet has a fuller veg meal selection, including **Palak Paneer**, **Veg Pulao**, **Kadai Vegetable**, **Vegetable Dum Biryani**, **Kulcha**, and **Aloo Tikki**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d120a?QueryProp1=Food%20%26%20Drink) &gt; **KFC-G28** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 28 Level 1, Domestic Departure &gt; If you want a quick snack, this outlet has **2 Pc Veg Strips** and **1 Pc Hot and Crispy**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d121a?QueryProp1=2%20Pc%20Veg%20Strips) &gt; **Starbucks G14** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 14 Level 1, Domestic Departure &gt; Good for a light veg bite. Available items include **Hawaiian Veg Club Sandwich** and **Paneer Tikka Sandwich**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76afa8259252b0e5d110c?QueryProp1=Hawaiian%20Veg%20Club%20Sandwich) &gt; **Aubree** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - T1 Kerb Side &gt; You can find **Italian Veg Calzone** and **Smokey Grilled Veg Sub** here. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d1au1?QueryProp1=Italian%20Veg%20Calzone) &gt; **BARLEY &amp; GRAPES CAFE** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - The Quad by BLR, Opposite Arrivals &gt; This is a nice landside option with **Assorted Veg Crostini Platter** and **Assorted Veg Bruschetta Platter**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d179a?QueryProp1=Assorted%20Veg%20Crostini%20Platter) &gt; **Chaipoint Kerbside** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerb Side, Opposite Arrival Gate &gt; A quick veg snack option with **Veg Pizza Puff**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d141a?QueryProp1=Veg%20Pizza%20Puff) &gt; **Hatti Kaapi** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerb Side, Opposite Arrival Gate &gt; You can get **Spinach &amp; Corn Sandwich With Fries** and **Pepper Mushroom Sandwich With Fries** here. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d112a?QueryProp1=Spinach%20%26%20Corn%20Sandwich%20With%20Fries) If you’d like, I can also narrow this down to: - quick veg snacks - full veg meals - kerbside options only - gate-wise options" id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mithai" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here are the mithai options I could find across the airport: **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **SMOOR T1** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Gate 15 &amp; Level 1 &gt; This outlet has **Artisanal Baklava Tin - 16Pc**, which is a sweet gifting option. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/651d0723de3efc67709d0ae1?QueryProp1=Artisanal%20Baklava%20Tin%20-%2016Pc) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **THE MITHAI BOX** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Domestic, Level 3, Departure &gt; Open 24 hours and focused on traditional mithai such as Mysore Pak, Dharwad Peda, and other classic sweets. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience/retail-store) &gt; **Bhartiya Jalpan** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Forecourt, Arrivals &gt; Open 24 hours and known for Indian traditional sweets &amp; savouries made with pure desi ghee. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience/culinary-experience) &gt; **Anand** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3, Departure &gt; Open 24 hours and offers premium Indian sweets and savouries. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience/retail-store) If you’d like, I can also narrow this down to **sweet shops in T1 only** or **mithai in T2 arrivals/departures only**." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Medical shop" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. I could find pharmacy-related options at BLR Airport. Since you asked broadly for a medical shop, I’m sharing the available pharmacy/medical outlet information across the airport. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Apollo Pharmacy** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Before Security Check, Level 1 &gt; This pharmacy is available before security and is convenient if you are in the landside area. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) &gt; **Manipal Airport Medical Centre** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Kerbside &gt; Apollo Pharmacy is also available on the kerb at the Manipal Airport Medical Centre, which can be helpful for quick medical needs before entering the terminal. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) &gt; **BLR Airport Medical Centre** &gt; **Zone:** Adjacent to Terminal 1 Building &gt; The medical centre is open 24/7 for passengers and the public. The Terminal 1 clinic is the Manipal Clinic at Level 1, accessible by the escalator alongside counter #86. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/airport-medical-services) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Apollo Pharmacy** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Check-in Hall (Departures), Level 3, Near Departure Gate #3 &gt; This is the pharmacy location mentioned for Terminal 2. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) &gt; **BLR Airport Medical Centre** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Departure Area, Level 3, Next to Gate #3 &gt; The Terminal 2 clinic is the Apollo Clinic, and it is open 24/7 for passengers and the public. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/airport-medical-services) If you’d like, I can also help you with the nearest medical help based on whether you are at T1, T2, or kerbside." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="What medical assistance is available?" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. BLR Airport has 24/7 medical support for passengers and the public, with clinics in both terminals. If you need urgent help, please go to the nearest medical centre or speak to airport staff immediately. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **BLR Airport Medical Centre - Manipal Clinic** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Level 1, adjacent to the Terminal 1 building &gt; Open 24/7 for passengers and the public. Take the escalator alongside counter #86 to reach the clinic. &gt; **Duty Medical Officer:** +91 9606954038 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/airport-medical-services) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **BLR Airport Medical Centre - Apollo Clinic** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 3, Departure Area next to Gate #3 &gt; Open 24/7 for passengers and the public. &gt; **Duty Medical Officer:** +91 8884122433 &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/airport-medical-services) For assistance related to the Manipal Centre, you may also contact: **Duty Medical Officer (Manipal Centre):** +91 9606954037 If you need mobility support, passengers requiring wheelchair assistance should request it through their airline at least 24 hours before departure." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Vacancy" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. For job vacancies and career opportunities at BLR Airport, you can explore the official careers page and apply through the authorised channel. Please be careful about fraudulent job offers and never pay any processing fee to anyone claiming to represent BIAL. **Careers** &gt; **Careers** &gt; **Zone:** Corporate &gt; Explore career opportunities here: [Click to explore career opportunities](https://bialtalent.peoplestrong.com/home) &gt; &gt; For queries, you may write to: **careers@bialairport.com** &gt; &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/corporate/careers) If you would like, I can also help you with the official email for applications or share the fraud warning details from the careers page." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="How to apply for airport jobs?" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. You can apply for airport jobs by sending your profile to **careers@bialairport.com**. For the latest career opportunities, you may also visit our careers page and apply through the official BIAL recruitment channel. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **BIAL Careers** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Careers / Recruitment &gt; Candidates can email their profiles to **careers@bialairport.com**. Please be careful about fraudulent job offers; BIAL does not ask applicants to pay any processing fee or deposit money for a job. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/corporate/careers) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **BIAL Careers** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Careers / Recruitment &gt; Candidates can email their profiles to **careers@bialairport.com**. Please be careful about fraudulent job offers; BIAL does not ask applicants to pay any processing fee or deposit money for a job. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/corporate/careers) If you would like, I can also help you with the official contact details for BIAL careers." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Careers" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. If you’re looking for career opportunities at BLR Airport, you can explore openings through our careers portal. BIAL also advises passengers and applicants to be careful about fraudulent job offers and to verify any communication claiming to be from the airport. **Careers** &gt; **Career Opportunities** &gt; Explore current opportunities here: https://bialtalent.peoplestrong.com/home &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/corporate/careers) &gt; **Authorised Careers Email** &gt; For job-related queries or to send your profile, use: careers@bialairport.com &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/corporate/careers) Please note that BIAL states it does not ask candidates to pay processing fees or deposit money for jobs. If you receive any suspicious offer, please verify it carefully before responding." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Chaayos" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for reaching out. Here are the Chaayos options available at BLR: **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Chaayos** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Departure Hall &gt; Open 24 hours. You can find Chaayos at the arrival/departure side in Terminal 2, and it offers a wide range of tea choices such as Chai Kulahd, Chai Vegan, Chai Almond, Chai Kesar, Chai Desi, Tea GingerHoney, Chai Gods, Lemon Iced Tea, Chai Sulemani, Chai Baarish Lemongrass, and Filter Coffee. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience/culinary-experience) &gt; **Chaayos** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Departure Hall &gt; Open 24 hours. This outlet is listed with the same Chaayos brand and serves the same tea range for passengers in Terminal 2. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/64d09a82d3be5d5cec44b290?QueryProp1=Chai%20Kulahd) **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Chai Point** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Domestic Departures, Level 0, Opposite Gate # 21 &gt; Open 24 hours. If you are in Terminal 1, this is the tea option available in the same style of chai/snacks experience. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/at-the-airport/experience) If you’d like, I can also help you with the nearest tea option by terminal or by your gate." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="brut" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. I found fragrance and grooming-related options for “brut” at BLR. Since you did not mention a terminal, I’m sharing the available options across both terminals, and I’ve kept the duty free items separate for easy checking. **Terminal 1 Options** No matching “brut” fragrance or grooming items were found in Terminal 1. **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Duty Free Arrival** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 0 International Baggage Claim Area &gt; Available items matching “brut” include **CHANDON BRUT (BOT)**, **Sula Brut Tropicale (BOT)**, **1 Million**, **1 Million Elixir**, **Invictus**, **Le Male Elixir Absolu**, **Nuit Homme Set**, **Big Pony Blue Men**, **Born in Roma Donna Intense**, **Coastal Cypress &amp; Sea Fennel**, **CK One**, and **Rhubarb &amp; Rose Hand Wash**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/60ed76aca8258362b0e5d144a?QueryProp1=1%20Million) &gt; **Duty Free Departure** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Level 1 &gt; Available items matching “brut” include **H24**, **CK One**, **CK Everyone**, **Beau De Jour**, **1 Million Set**, **Olympéa**, **L'Homme Intense**, **L'Homme L'Eau**, **L'Homme Cologne Bleue**, **Eau d’Ombré Leather Eau de Toilette**, **Memori Reve Lotus**, **For Him Bleu Noir**, **Le Male Parfum Intense**, **Eau De Rhubarbe Écarlate**, **Pasha Noir Absolu**, **Invictus Travel Set**, **Rhubarb &amp; Rose Hand Wash**, and **Moil Brumes Du Maroc**. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/storefront/64d09a82d3be5d5cec40la690dut1?QueryProp1=H24) If you meant a specific product like “brut fragrance,” “brut deodorant,” or “brut grooming,” please tell me the exact item name and I’ll narrow it down for you." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Apollo" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Here is the Apollo Pharmacy information available at BLR Airport: **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Apollo Pharmacy** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Before Security Check, Level 1 &gt; Apollo Pharmacy is available before security check at Level 1 and on the kerb at Manipal Airport Medical Centre. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Apollo Pharmacy** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Check-in Hall (Departures), Level 3 near Departure Gate #3 &gt; Apollo Pharmacy is located at T2 check-in hall (departures), level 3 near departure gate #3. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial) If you’d like, I can also help you with the nearest medical centre or other airport facilities." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="slot-booking" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. If you’re looking for slot booking at BLR, the PreSecure Lane (EZPass by BLR) is available only at Terminal 1, Zone D security checkpoint, Level 0. You can book your security slot through the BLR Pulse app, and it is meant to help you choose a preferred time to join the security queue. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **PreSecure Lane (EZPass by BLR)** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Zone D Security Checkpoint, Level 0 &gt; This is a queue access management facility, not a fast-track security service. You need a valid boarding pass and a QR code generated in the BLR Pulse app. Slots open up to 4 hours before departure and are not permitted within 60 minutes of departure. Please arrive within your booked time window, ideally within ±5 minutes. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/ezpass) To book it, open the BLR Pulse app, upload or scan your boarding pass, choose your preferred slot, and then complete the booking. If you need help at the airport, you may also approach the terminal staff near Zone D security. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/ezpass) If you’d like, I can also help you with the booking window, eligibility, or where exactly to go in Terminal 1." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Wheelchair" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. If you need wheelchair support at BLR Airport, please request it through your airline in advance. The airport asks passengers to place the request at the time of booking or at least 48 hours before travel, and for Mobility Assist, at least 24 hours before departure. **Terminal 1 Options** &gt; **Wheelchair Assistance** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - PRM/PwD support &gt; Passengers can request wheelchair assistance through their airline. Dedicated PRM/PwD drop-off is available at Lane 1 (behind Third Wave Coffee), Lane 2, and Lane 3. The wheelchair assistance counter is next to Entry Gate 5A, and the dedicated PRM entry for departures is Gate 5A. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/wheelchair-assistance) &gt; **Mobility Assist** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 1 - Special assistance &gt; This service supports People with Disabilities with smoother boarding and deplaning, with coordinated support through your airline. Please inform your airline at least 24 hours before departure. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/mobility-assist) **Terminal 2 Options** &gt; **Wheelchair Assistance** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - PRM/PwD support &gt; Passengers can request wheelchair assistance through their airline. Dedicated PRM/PwD drop-off is available at Level 3 Departure Lane 1 and the PRM drop-off area next to the CarebyBLR counter. The wheelchair assistance counter is on Level 3 Lane 1 near CarebyBLR counters, and the dedicated PRM entry for departures is on Level 3. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/wheelchair-assistance) &gt; **Mobility Assist** &gt; **Zone:** Terminal 2 - Special assistance &gt; This service supports People with Disabilities with smoother boarding and deplaning, with coordinated support through your airline. Please inform your airline at least 24 hours before departure. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/services/special-assistance/mobility-assist) If you are using a personal wheelchair, please check the approval process with your airline in advance." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="First time flight assistance" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. If this is your first time flying from BLR, I can help you with the basic steps so your journey feels much easier and less stressful. Please tell me whether you are arriving at the airport, checking in, or already past security, and I will guide you step by step. For a smooth first-time experience, the usual flow is: 1. Reach the correct terminal for your airline and flight type. 2. Keep your ID and ticket/booking details ready. 3. Check in at the airline counter or use self check-in if available. 4. Drop your baggage if needed. 5. Clear security and proceed to your departure area. 6. Follow the gate number on your boarding pass and airport screens. If you want, I can also help you with: - Which terminal to go to - Check-in and baggage steps - Security process - Gate finding - Food, lounge, or transport options at BLR" id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Health declaration forma" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. I could not find a specific health declaration form for passengers in the available airport information. For the most accurate and direct assistance, please reach out to customer support at **+91-80-22012001** or **+91-80-66785555**, message us via WhatsApp at **+91-8884998888**, or visit **[Airline Partners Information | Airlines at Bangalore Airport](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/airline-partners-information)** for the latest airline-specific guidance. **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/corporate/media/news-press-releases/blr-airport-achieves-aci-airport-health-accreditation)" id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Asureed ceb" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. I could help with **Your Assured Cab** at BLR. It offers **flat 15% off with code CAB15**, and the service highlights **zero waiting charges, zero surge charges, and zero cancellation charges**. If your flight gets delayed, you can notify the service and they will schedule accordingly. **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/cabs)" id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Upgrade the ticket from economy to business class booked thru this app" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. For a ticket booked through this app, the available booking information mentions that some fares may include flexible rebooking and upgrade options, but the actual upgrade process is handled by the airline. If you are looking to change from Economy to Business Class, please check the airline’s manage booking or contact their customer care directly for the exact upgrade availability. **Flight Booking** &gt; **Cathay Pacific Booking Information** &gt; **Zone:** Flight Booking &gt; Some Economy fares may offer flexible rebooking and upgrade options. Business Class is also available on select Cathay Pacific flights. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/corporate/media/news-press-releases/now-fly-cathay-pacific-from-bengaluru-to-hong-kong-) &gt; **Flight Booking Portal** &gt; **Zone:** Flight Booking &gt; The booking platform mentions transparent pricing and flight booking support, but it does not provide a direct airport-managed upgrade service. &gt; **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/flights) If you would like, I can also help you with the airline contact details or guide you on what to check in manage booking." id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="How to contact the airline?" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. For airline-related help, please contact your respective airline directly. If you need BLR Airport assistance for general queries, you can reach us on WhatsApp at **+91-8884998888** or call **+91-80-22012001** / **+91-80-66785555**. **Airline Contact Information** Please visit the airline partners page for the most accurate airline phone numbers, email addresses, and support details: **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/airline-partners-information) **BLR Airport Contact** WhatsApp: **+91-8884998888** Phone: **+91-80-22012001** / **+91-80-66785555** **Reference:** [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/passenger-services/faqs-about-blr-airport-bial)" id="is_answered_by">
      <data key="d4">is_answered_by</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
